%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrap": true, "width": 130, "actorMargin": 40, "messageMargin": 28, "noteMargin": 6}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Browser or Publisher
  participant G as Gateway + MediaAuthorizer
  participant M as MediaApi
  participant DB as media_db
  participant S as S3 source bucket
  C->>G: POST /api/media/uploads/reservations (cookie)
  G->>DB: authorizer reads current user row
  G->>M: invoke with trusted actor {owner_id, role}
  M->>DB: insert UploadReservation (15 min, server-chosen key)
  M-->>C: reservation_id, asset_id, presigned POST
  C->>S: POST bytes with presigned fields (no cookie, no API)
  C->>G: POST .../reservations/{id}/finalize
  G->>M: invoke with actor
  M->>S: HEAD, then GET at VersionId: size, SHA-256, signature
  M->>DB: one transaction: pin VersionId, insert Asset, stage submit in outbox
  M-->>C: 202 Accepted, job_id = asset_id
